{"id":"c65c768099ba0767","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-finite-basis.md","title":"Finite Basis Theorem","display":"Finite Basis Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-finite-basis","aliases":["93-thm-finite-basis"],"display":"Finite Basis Theorem","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-finite-algebra]]","[[93-df-equational-class]]","[[93-df-congruence-distributive]]","[[93-df-equation]]","[[93-df-finite-subset]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-finite-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-finite-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Finite Basis Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" href=\"?note=32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" title=\"93-df-finite-algebra\">93-df-finite-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e317109be82f65fa\" href=\"?note=e317109be82f65fa\" title=\"93-df-congruence-distributive\">93-df-congruence-distributive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" href=\"?note=1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" title=\"93-df-equation\">93-df-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-finite-basis-—-Finite-Basis-Theorem\">thm-finite-basis — Finite Basis Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(S)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\{\\mathbf A\\});\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\{\\mathbf A\\});\\tau)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\)</span> are the sourced equation set and model-class operator.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}basis}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\{\\mathbf A\\});\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists E\\in[\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\{\\mathbf A\\})\n=\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}(E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}basis}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\{\\mathbf A\\});\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists E\\in[\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\{\\mathbf A\\})\n=\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}(E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is Baker's finite basis theorem.  Finiteness of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> alone is not sufficient; the finite-signature and congruence-distributivity hypotheses are essential to this formulation.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-finite-basis-—-Finite-Basis-Theorem","text":"thm-finite-basis — Finite Basis Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"32c4e6b205cc3cd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","loca